	/// PRESENTATION: Total Turnover Rolling 12 SMLY
	/// Returns the annualised Total Turnover rate over the 12-month rolling window ending at the same month
	/// last year. Used as the reference point for Rolling 12 vs SMLY variance.
	/// Total Leavers in the window divided by average monthly headcount
	/// (sum of Avg Monthly Headcount over the window / 12).
