	/// PRESENTATION: Net Movement
	/// Returns Net Movement (Starters minus Total Leavers) for the selected reporting month. Negative when leavers exceed starters.
	/// Use: Cards, charts and tables, including Gender-rows tables (one column, gender in the rows).
	measure 'Net Movement' = EXTERNALMEASURE("Net Movement", DOUBLE, "DirectQuery to AS - HR_Metrics")
