	/// PRESENTATION: Net Movement SMLY
	/// Returns Net Movement for the same month in the prior year.
	/// Used as the reference value for the vs SMLY absolute variance.
	/// Use: Cards, charts and tables, including Gender-rows tables (one column, gender in the rows).
