	/// PRESENTATION: Net Movement YTD PY
	/// Returns cumulative Net Movement from 1 January of the prior year
	/// to the same month in the prior year inclusive.
	/// Used as the reference value for the YTD vs YTD PY absolute variance.
	/// Use: Cards, charts and tables, including Gender-rows tables (one column, gender in the rows).
