	/// VARIANCE: Net Movement vs SMLY
	/// Returns the absolute difference between Net Movement for the
	/// selected reporting month and the same month last year.
	/// Absolute only — no % variant (metric crosses zero).
	/// Use: Cards, charts and tables, including Gender-rows tables (one column, gender in the rows).
